  "description": "Export paginated SSRS / Power BI reports run by DocWright.Reporting to Word (DOCX), Excel (XLSX), CSV and plain text. Word gets the positioning grid Reporting Services' own Word renderer produces, or a flow document; Excel gets numeric cells with the report's formats, one sheet or one per page, and drill-down toggles as the row outline; CSV is the report's data, not a picture of the page. Charts, gauges, maps and barcodes reach Word and Excel as pictures. Every export reads the same page model as the PDF and image renderers, so all outputs paginate identically.",
  "iconFile": "package-icon.png",
